# wyoming-piper — text-to-speech for Home Assistant.
#
# The voice itself is a GLOBAL: EXIST_MODEL_TTS_VOICE in .env.shared, read
# straight from docker-compose.yml at container start. Nothing to set here.
#
# Browse voices: https://rhasspy.github.io/piper-samples/
# Naming is <lang>_<REGION>-<name>-<quality>, e.g. en_US-lessac-medium.
# "medium" is the quality/latency sweet spot on CPU; "low" is faster and
# noticeably more robotic; "high" is slower than real time on modest hardware.
